  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -IR verb; fully regular",
    "The non-reflexive \"difundir\" means to broadcast/to spread (something) — transitive",
    "\"Difundirse\" is the intransitive/passive form: the news spread, the rumour spread",
    "Past participle: difundido",
    "Common context: noticias que se difunden = news that spreads; rumores que se difunden = rumours that spread"
